OL,3,GNEWSACars falling off 'accident waiting
OL,4,Ato happen' road
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is "only a matter of time" before
OL,7,Fsomeone is seriously injured on a
OL,8,Fdangerous bend, a resident has warned.
OL,10,FAllan Pennock said the verge on a
OL,11,Fstretch of Grinkle Lane, in
OL,12,FSaltburn-by-the-Sea, dropped away years
OL,13,Fago and six cars had gone over the edge
OL,14,Fof it since 2023.
OL,16,FThe 76-year-old said he contacted the
OL,17,Fcouncil after the first car went over,
OL,18,Fbut little had been done to fix it.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,392,390,260,160,0,100
